    "short_description": "Business Insurance is a leading media source established in 1967, dedicated to serving senior-level corporate executives and professionals in the fields of risk management, risk transfer, and risk financing. The organization provides in-depth analysis, strategic guidance, and market intelligence to help its audience navigate the complexities of the insurance industry.\n\nThe company publishes a periodic magazine that covers various topics, including property and liability insurance, workers' compensation, and disability management. This publication is distributed to a specialized audience, including risk managers, insurers, and brokers, who are responsible for managing corporate insurance and self-insurance programs. Business Insurance is committed to delivering valuable insights and case studies that support effective risk management strategies.",
